msgctxt "zUbsmj"
msgid "{dateKind, select, month {Not even a whole day covers everything in depth by {date}.} other {Not even a whole day covers everything in depth by {date}.}}"
msgstr "{dateKind, select, month {Ni estudiando todo el día se puede cubrir todo a fondo para {date}.} other {Ni estudiando todo el día se puede cubrir todo a fondo para el {date}.}}"

#. In the month form, {date} is a month, like "May 2027"; otherwise a day, like "May 5". {time} is a daily study time, like "13 h 30 min".
#: src/_components/time-answer-texts.ts
msgctxt "I9fMB3"
msgid "{dateKind, select, month {Covering everything in depth by {date} takes about {time} a day, more than most people can keep up.} other {Covering everything in depth by {date} takes about {time} a day, more than most people can keep up.}}"
msgstr "{dateKind, select, month {Cubrir todo a fondo para {date} requiere aproximadamente {time} al día, un ritmo que la mayoría no puede mantener.} other {Cubrir todo a fondo para el {date} requiere aproximadamente {time} al día, un ritmo que la mayoría no puede mantener.}}"

#. Part of the goal never fits, whatever the time, so this is the most any daily time covers. In the month form, {date} is a month, like "May 2027"; otherwise a day, like "May 5". {time} is a daily study time, like "8 h"; {share} a percentage, like "99%".
#: src/_components/time-answer-texts.ts
msgctxt "MTkVRt"
msgid "{dateKind, select, month {Covering as much as any daily time can by {date}, about {share} in depth, takes about {time} a day, more than most people can keep up.} other {Covering as much as any daily time can by {date}, about {share} in depth, takes about {time} a day, more than most people can keep up.}}"
msgstr "{dateKind, select, month {Cubrir lo máximo posible para {date}, aproximadamente {share} a fondo, requiere aproximadamente {time} al día, un ritmo que la mayoría no puede mantener.} other {Cubrir lo máximo posible para el {date}, aproximadamente {share} a fondo, requiere aproximadamente {time} al día, un ritmo que la mayoría no puede mantener.}}"

#. In the month form, {date} is a month, like "May 2027"; otherwise a day, like "May 5".
#: src/_components/time-answer-texts.ts
msgctxt "AVgtRb"
msgid "{dateKind, select, month {Covers about {share} of your exam topics in depth by {date}, starting with what comes up most.} other {Covers about {share} of your exam topics in depth by {date}, starting with what comes up most.}}"
msgstr "{dateKind, select, month {Cubre a fondo aproximadamente {share} de los temas de tu examen para {date}, empezando por los que más aparecen.} other {Cubre a fondo aproximadamente {share} de los temas de tu examen para el {date}, empezando por los que más aparecen.}}"

#. In the month form, {date} is a month, like "May 2027"; otherwise a day, like "May 5".
#: src/_components/time-answer-texts.ts
msgctxt "Tampv1"
msgid "{dateKind, select, month {Covers about {share} of your goal in depth by {date}, starting with what matters most.} other {Covers about {share} of your goal in depth by {date}, starting with what matters most.}}"
msgstr "{dateKind, select, month {Cubre a fondo aproximadamente {share} de tu objetivo para {date}, empezando por lo más importante.} other {Cubre a fondo aproximadamente {share} de tu objetivo para el {date}, empezando por lo más importante.}}"

#. {share} is a percentage, like "32%": how much of everything gets studied in depth, not how many topics are reached.
#: src/_components/time-answer-texts.ts
msgctxt "llz5RA"
msgid "Your plan then covers every exam topic, the ones asked most in more depth. That's about {share} of the exam studied in depth."
msgstr "Así, tu plan cubre todos los temas del examen y profundiza más en los que más aparecen. Eso equivale a estudiar a fondo aproximadamente {share} del examen."

#. {share} is a percentage, like "32%": how much of everything gets studied in depth, not how many topics are reached.
#: src/_components/time-answer-texts.ts
msgctxt "lKM-91"
msgid "Your plan then starts with what the exam asks most, about {share} of it studied in depth. Topics it asks least may not fit."
msgstr "Así, tu plan empieza por los temas más frecuentes del examen y cubre a fondo aproximadamente {share} del contenido. Los temas menos frecuentes podrían quedar fuera."

#. {share} is a percentage, like "32%": how much of everything gets studied in depth, not how many topics are reached.
#: src/_components/time-answer-texts.ts
msgctxt "xjYmua"
msgid "Your plan then covers every part of your goal, what matters most in more depth. That's about {share} of it studied in depth."
msgstr "Así, tu plan cubre todo el contenido de tu objetivo y profundiza más en lo más importante. Eso equivale a estudiar a fondo aproximadamente {share} de tu objetivo."

#. {share} is a percentage, like "32%": how much of everything gets studied in depth, not how many topics are reached.
#: src/_components/time-answer-texts.ts
msgctxt "NaIXds"
msgid "Your plan then starts with what matters most, about {share} of your goal studied in depth. The rest may not fit."
msgstr "Así, tu plan empieza por lo más importante y cubre a fondo aproximadamente {share} de tu objetivo. El resto podría quedar fuera."

